 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <p class="show-type" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Talk</p>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Creative Authorship and the James Bond Franchise, Past and Future" href="/whats-on/creative-authorship-and-the-james-bond-franchise-past-and-future" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Creative Authorship and the James Bond Franchise, Past and Future<span data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf> - UEA Film50</span></a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="status" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Sold out</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>UEA scholars Dr Llewella Chapman and Dr Claire Hines examine who has shaped James Bond’s past and who may define its future.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="workData" role="group" aria-label="Show information" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <time itemprop="duration" datetime="PT1H30M" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>1h 30m</time>
  </div>
 </div>
