 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Cunk on Cinema" href="/whats-on/cunk-on-cinema" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Cunk on Cinema<span data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf> - TV Preview</span></a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="status" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Sold out</p>
   </div>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Charlie Brooker and Diane Morgan’s hilarious creation turns her eye to the moving image, with this singular take on what makes cinema so alluring.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="workData" role="group" aria-label="Show information" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
