 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Daughters of the Dust" href="/whats-on/daughters-of-the-dust" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Daughters of the Dust</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The first feature film directed by an African American woman to get a theatrical release, Julie Dash’s debut has paved the way for generations of filmmakers.</p>
  </div>
