 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <p class="show-type" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Seniors</p>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Deep Cover" href="/whats-on/deep-cover" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Deep Cover</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>An undercover cop infiltrates a powerful drug empire, only to find the line between justice and corruption disappearing as his double life consumes him.</p>
