 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Double Indemnity" href="/whats-on/double-indemnity" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Double Indemnity</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Billy Wilder’s breakout feature – and an iconic entry into the film noir canon – features an indomitable Barbara Stanwyck and more than a little moral turpitude.</p>
