 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Fatherland" href="/whats-on/fatherland" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Fatherland</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Paweł Pawlikowski’s postwar portrait of Thomas Mann and his daughter is elegant, understated and richly layered – riven with private and collective traumas, and yearning for a lost homeland.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="workData" role="group" aria-label="Show information" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <time itemprop="duration" datetime="PT1H22M" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>1h 22m</time><span aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>|</span><span data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>2026</span>
  </div>
 </div>
