   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Fear of the Dark: Lola Young on Race, Gender and Sexuality in Cinema" href="/whats-on/fear-of-the-dark-lola-young-on-race-gender-and-sexuality-in-cinema" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Fear of the Dark: Lola Young on Race, Gender and Sexuality in Cinema</a></h3>
