 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Fedora" href="/whats-on/fedora" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Fedora</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>A prescient takedown of celebrity commodification, Fedora sees Billy Wilder revisit the plot of an ageing star whose reclusive lifestyle is interrupted.</p>
  </div>
