   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Filipiñana" href="/whats-on/filipinana" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Filipiñana</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Winner of Sundance’s World Cinema Dramatic Special Jury Award, Rafael Manuel’s feature debut is a haunting fable exposing the privilege and violence beneath a paradise’s immaculate facade.</p>
