   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Five Graves to Cairo" href="/whats-on/five-graves-to-cairo" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Five Graves to Cairo</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>In Billy Wilder’s impressive wartime drama a destitute soldier hiding in plain sight is forced to improvise when he is mistaken for a German spy.</p>
