   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The Palme d’Or winning director of 4 Months, 3 Weeks and 2 Days joined the rarified group of directors to receive Cannes Film Festival’s top prize twice, with this portrait of cultures clashing in a small Norwegian community.</p>
