 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Flame in the Streets" href="/whats-on/flame-in-the-streets" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Flame in the Streets</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>A committed trade union boss fights against discrimination at work while being confronted with his own racial prejudices when his daughter falls in love with a Jamaican teacher.</p>
  </div>
