 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="A Foreign Affair" href="/whats-on/a-foreign-affair" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>A Foreign Affair</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Jean Arthur is a fish out of water in post-war Berlin, a world of crumbling nightclubs, illicit affairs and corruption.</p>
  </div>
